Copyright 2025 Fabricio Pasapera Viera (@Hadez)

Modifications made in 2026:
- Added Zed blurred-background appearance metadata.
- Added alpha transparency to window and surface backgrounds.
- Made editor, panel, tab bar, terminal, toolbar, gutter, and scrollbar track
  backgrounds transparent.
- Retained the Mix and Flat palettes as focused dark variants.
- Reworked tabs, selections, icons, editor lines, and focus states with
  independent Lucent Blur interaction colors.
- Renamed generated themes under the independent Lucent Blur series.

The transparency approach was informed by Catppuccin Blur for Zed:
https://github.com/jenslys/zed-catppuccin-blur

